{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/aaib-reports/experimental-drone-variant-4j-uas-registration-n-slash-a","content_id":"6ba231ff-5996-418a-b879-4c4fac1732e0","description":"Loss of navigational control, emergency flight termination, Salisbury Plain Training Area, Wiltshire, 11 December 2025","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"be93d53a-c0a9-4a21-8c6d-ee451b0b13d5","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-02T16:40:02+01:00","id":"be93d53a-c0a9-4a21-8c6d-ee451b0b13d5","title":"Glossary of abbreviations","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:40:02+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce8dd240178298997ef000/Glossary_of_abbreviations.pdf"},{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"f856a785-151d-465d-9c3a-44e288b881d2","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-02T16:40:50+01:00","id":"f856a785-151d-465d-9c3a-44e288b881d2","title":"Experimental Drone Variant 4J, UAS registration N-A 04-26","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:40:50+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce8e02b168efedf97eefe8/Experimental_Drone_Variant_4J_UAS_registration_N-A_04-26.pdf"}],"body":"<p>During a verification and validation test flight of a fixed wing UA command and control was lost.  The flight was terminated when it was confirmed the UA was over a safe area.  The UA descended to the ground and the wreckage recovered.  A fault was found within its navigation module which caused it to breach the geofenced area in which it was flying.  The operator has taken safety actions which introduce a fall-back logic within the system which can switch to other navigational sources and has modified the user interface to provide a clear alert to the remote pilot in the event of a positioning data anomaly.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"download-the-report\">Download the report:</h3>\n<p><span id=\"attachment_f856a785-151d-465d-9c3a-44e288b881d2\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce8e02b168efedf97eefe8/Experimental_Drone_Variant_4J_UAS_registration_N-A_04-26.pdf\">Experimental Drone Variant 4J, UAS registration N-A 04-26</a></span></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"download-glossary-of-abbreviations\">Download glossary of abbreviations:</h3>\n<p><span id=\"attachment_be93d53a-c0a9-4a21-8c6d-ee451b0b13d5\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce8dd240178298997ef000/Glossary_of_abbreviations.pdf\">Glossary of abbreviations</a></span></p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:00:19Z"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"aircraft_category":["unmanned-aircraft-systems"],"aircraft_type":"Experimental Drone Variant 4J","date_of_occurrence":"2025-12-11","location":"Salisbury Plain Training Area, Wiltshire","registration":"n/a","report_type":"correspondence-investigation"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"aaib_report","first_published_at":"2026-04-09T10:00:19+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/aaib-reports/experimental-drone-variant-4j-uas-registration-n-slash-a","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/aaib-reports/experimental-drone-variant-4j-uas-registration-n-slash-a","base_path":"/aaib-reports/experimental-drone-variant-4j-uas-registration-n-slash-a","content_id":"6ba231ff-5996-418a-b879-4c4fac1732e0","document_type":"aaib_report","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-04-09T09:00:19Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"AAIB investigation to Experimental Drone Variant 4J, (UAS registration n/a)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/aaib-reports/experimental-drone-variant-4j-uas-registration-n-slash-a","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/aaib-reports","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/aaib-reports","base_path":"/aaib-reports","content_id":"b7574bba-969f-4c49-855a-ae1586258ff6","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Commercial - fixed wing","value":"commercial-fixed-wing